/// prediction, warped and overlapped motion, global motion, hidden pyramid frames and
/// show_existing_frame reordering. Every displayed frame must be exactly equal to dav1d's output,
/// verified by per-frame SHA-256 digests over the cropped planes.
/// </summary>
